## Next Steps

To enable Web Analytics in production:
1. Deploy this code to Vercel using `vercel deploy` or via Git integration
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard under the Analytics section
3. Analytics data will start appearing after users visit your deployed site
4. Verify tracking by checking the browser Network tab for `/<unique-path>/view` requests

## Notes
- The Analytics component will automatically track page views and user interactions
- No additional configuration is required for basic analytics functionality
- The component is non-blocking and won't affect page load performance
- Analytics works in production mode; development mode may show limited functionality
